/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.swp
.DS_Store
.claude/
.env

# Stray node_modules at the repo root — `npx ctx7@latest` and
# friends initialize one when run from here. The real frontend
# dep tree lives under longbox-frontend/node_modules/ and is
# managed by pnpm.
/node_modules/

# Built frontend bundle — generated by `pnpm build` in longbox-frontend/.
# Step 7 keeps `longbox-web/frontend-dist/index.html` as a tracked
# placeholder so `cargo build` works on a fresh clone; everything under
# `_app/` and `favicon.ico` (etc.) is regenerated.
longbox-web/frontend-dist/_app/
longbox-web/frontend-dist/favicon.ico

# Session-bridge / handoff docs — local working notes between Claude Code
# sessions, not project files.
longbox-handoff-*.md

# Databases and backups - never commit these to a public repo
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
longbox-backup-*
docs/progress-*.md
